        "It stops the outer loop",
        "It starts a new line once a row is printed"
      ],
      "answer": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "q8",
      "text": "What does this print?",
      "code": "matrix = [\n    [1, 2],\n    [3, 4]\n]\ntotal = 0\nfor row in matrix:\n    for element in row:\n        total += element\nprint(total)",
