      "text": "Why does the lesson start `biggest` at `matrix[0][0]` and not at 0?",
      "options": [
        "If every number were negative, 0 would win though it isn't in the matrix",
        "Because 0 can't be compared with a number from a list",
        "Because the biggest number is always the first one",
        "So the loop can skip the first row"
